=== river ===
A dark, stuffy room. Uncomfortably hot.[WAFI] A dreamless sleep fell away from my mind as I slowly remembered that I was alive.[WAFI] Thoughts manifested of something important, so important, to which attending was far more important than any rest.

+ [Scroll short videos on your phone]
- I NEED to scroll short videos on my phone.[WAFI][CLER]

I open my eyes. Laying upon my girlfriend's no-doubt long dead arm, I grab my phone from next to me on the pillowcase and unlock it in a swift, well-practiced motion (a number password: the release date of my favourite film).[WAFI] I am confronted with, opened up to, the endless possibility of "phone". I know what I must do next.[WAFI]

Low volume, so as to not wake my sleeping pillow. Low brightness, perfectly adjusted for bed-time scrolling. App already open, ensuring total efficiency.

+ [Watch the first video]
- I scroll down, my first short video already in sight. It's a small NYC-based comedy group I follow, "smelly freak".[WAFI] In this sketch, the gay one is playing an elderly Italian man, and the woman his son.[WAFI] They want to get into a bodega, but there is an anti-Italian barrier.[WAFI] The video is 6 minutes long.[WAFI] It's New York, it's elevated. Other people would not understand. I do, because I visited New York when I was 14, and I watch a lot of videos. Excellent.

+ [Watch another video]
- I scroll again. It's a video of two incredibly attractive goth women making out.[WAFI] It has been reposted by an annoying woman I met in college who I still nontheless follow.[WAFI] This is so normalized for me that I do not consider unfollowing her.

+ [Watch another video]
- My endless march continues. It goes on for quite a while. Under me, the arm I'm resting on begins to twitch a bit, so I lift up slightly, and it slowly slinks back to Alice-Rose's body.[WAFI][CLER]

She shoots up.[WAFI]

"Babe" she mutters. On my phone is a video of a Chinese woman advertising heavy industrial machinery for food processing.[WAFI]

"Yes?" I respond, attentatively. Attentively? I wonder what kind of person buys industrial food processing equipment they see while scrolling their phone.[WAFI]

"It's the fucking, thing, today."[WAFI]

+ [The thing]
- It's the thing today.[WAFI][CLER]

There's this band Alice-Rose really likes. Suck the Count. No, Stop the Count. It's Stop the Count.[WAFI] They're an awful online scene band from many years ago that nerds really like whose music, in addition to being deeply misogynistic, is also awful.[WAFI] When she first played it for me she laughed so hard because she could see my face slowly drop as I realised how bad they are.[WAFI] Anyway, we went to uni with a couple girls whose band - saygoodbyeyesterday - is opening for them.[WAFI] They were hyped about it, somehow, and they invited us, so that's what we're doing today.[WAFI]

I scroll to the next video.[WAFI] It's a man covered in green paint, ordering at a restaurant.[WAFI] This is his gimmick, he's green and does things in public.[WAFI] It's New York, it's elevated.[WAFI]

"Yeah, it's today." I say, regarding the nature of today being the thing.[WAFI]

"I'm gonna shower. Could you make breakfast?"[WAFI]

+[Why are you showering before breakfast?]
-I roll over to face her. Why is she showering before breakfast?[WAFI]

"Why are you showering before breakfast?"  I ask.[WAFI]

"It's like, I'm really excited. So I want it to be a clean day."[WAFI]

"Wouldn't it still be a clean day if you shower later? And you're going to be wet. There'll be crumbs"[WAFI]

"There'll be crumbs..." she repeats.

+ [There'll be crumbs]
- There'll be crumbs.[WAFI]

She pauses for a second.[WAIT=1]

"Whatever," she says, visibly a bit irritated. "It's just the way I've always done things like this. I'm excited."[WAFI]

I shrug and say "alright, whatever. I'll get out of bed in a sec" before rolling back over.[WAFI]

Alice-Rose walks off to the shower, with a pace of walking that implies that she's somewhat irritated with me. Were I stupid, I would bring it up, but the baby knows not to rock the cradle.[WAFI] I quickly look up whether that's a saying.[WAFI][CLER]

Some time passes, but I'm still on my phone.

+ [Get up and make breakfast]
  I think about getting up to make breakfast.
+ + [Get up, make breakfast]
    I groan and roll over. I really do know I should get up.
+ + + [Seriously, get up and make breakfast]
      I roll over again, throwing myself off of the bed and onto the floor. I use the mental momentum to move to the kitchen.[WAFI]
      -> breakfast
+ + + [Watch more videos]
+ + [Watch more videos]
+ [Watch more videos]
- Unfortunately, the magnetic allure of short-form video content pulls me back in.[WAFI]
-> reels
  
=== reels ===
This time, the green man is joined by a blue woman. I click her profile to see whether she is always blue, or is just doing a bit for this video. In New York, things like these aren't a given.[WAFI] She does appear to make videos where she is blue. That's fascinating.[WAFI] As I keep scrolling her profile, I hear the sound of the shower being turned off.

+ [Fuck]
- Fuck!!![WAFI]

The instant burst of energy granted by knowing that I am, factually speaking, a moron fills me with the momentum to leap out of bread.[WAFI] I mean bed.[WAFI] I swiftly walk to the kitchen and put four slices of bread into the toaster.[WAFI] I hear footsteps behind me. Alice-Rose's voice startles me a little bit.

"You were watching some stupid bullshit in bed again and forgot to make breakfast."[WAFI]

"The green guy was with a blue woman. I wanted to see if she's blue recreationally or like, just for that video."[WAFI]

She laughs.[WAFI]

"What's your takeaway? Did you successfully bluevestigate her?"[WAFI]

"She's blue. She's been painting herself blue for a while, so she's not a poser."[WAFI]

"Well, I always wondered. Ever since I first heard about her, five seconds ago."[WAFI]

"I'm making toast."[WAFI]

"I thought you were just burning the bread to vent some anger."[WAFI]

"What do I have to be angry about?"[WAFI]

She doesn't respond.[WAFI] We eat breakfast in silence.[WAFI]
-> after_breakfast

=== breakfast ===
River gets up early and makes breakfast

After Alice-Rose finishes up in the shower, she comes out to find a finished breakfast

Alice-Rose is quite happy. The two eat and chat
-> after_breakfast

